  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Brand introduction:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 200; white-space: pre-line; float: none; display: inline;\">MARION - luxury maternity fashion | also sold by Bloomingdale's, Nordstrom, Macy's, and Babylist | Forbes vetted pick for Best Maternity Workwear Dress&nbsp; 2024 (Sarah dress)&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Product description:</strong> our styles are designed to be timeless, elegant, nursing-friendly, and flattering after pregnancy (really!). Our collection features maternity business clothes / workwear, knit dresses, leggings, nursing tops, maternity business suits, maternity skirts, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong> sustainable fabrics, including Italian stretch suiting fabrics and luxury TENCELS | Regular and Petite sizing | Wash at home fabrics</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Payment terms:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">We pay our affiliates every 2 weeks using PayPal or Venmo, depending on our affiliates' preferences. Payouts are released when the return window for purchases has passed.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Brand story:&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 200; white-space: pre-line; float: none; display: inline;\">Hi there! My name is Joy O&rsquo;Renick, and I'm the founder and CEO of MARION. When I became pregnant with my sons, I was an education executive and struggled to find maternity clothes that were formal enough for my job. As we know, pregnant &amp; nursing women are still often met with judgement &amp; questions about our career commitment when we become mothers. While we are all working to change that, we also need to ensure that pregnant women can continue to look our best on the job. Maternity is a time when the feeling of professional power becomes more important than ever. Women are rising higher in our professions than ever before. We're waiting longer to have our babies, meaning we're often pregnant in senior positions that demand better clothes. In a world where appearances matter, MARION believes quality workwear is a basic necessity for pregnant/breastfeeding women &amp; a vital ingredient in our progress toward equity. Women belong in the workforce. We belong in leadership. That doesn't change when we become mamas. Our professional polish shouldn't have to change either. That is MARION's mission. We hope you'll join us! Learn more about our brand at <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.marionmaternity.com\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.marionmaternity.com</a> or at our social sites.</span>&nbsp;</span></p>",
